.TH "AG\-CLI\-PR\-CREATE" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-pr\-create \- Create a pull request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli pr create [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Create a pull request and optionally set its collaboration metadata.
.PP
\&Assignees own follow\-up work, approval reviewers approve the change, and
\&testers verify it. These AtomGit roles are managed independently. Labels and
\&milestones must already exist in the repository.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-assignee <stringSlice>\fR
\&Assignee login (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-base <string>\fR
\&Base branch (defaults to repository default)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-b, \-\-body <string>\fR
\&PR body
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-F, \-\-body\-file <string>\fR
\&Read PR body from file (use \- for stdin)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-draft\fR
\&Mark pull request as a draft
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-head <string>\fR
\&Head branch
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-label <stringSlice>\fR
\&Label name (repeat for multiple labels)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-milestone <string>\fR
\&Milestone number or exact title
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-prune\-branch\fR
\&Delete the source branch after the PR is merged
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer <stringSlice>\fR
\&Approval reviewer login (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-tester <stringSlice>\fR
\&Tester login (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-t, \-\-title <string>\fR
\&PR title
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli pr create owner/repo \-\-title \(dqFix bug\(dq \-\-body \(dqDescription\(dq \-\-base main \-\-head feature
\&  ag\-cli pr create owner/repo \-\-title \(dqFix bug\(dq \-\-body \(dqDescription\(dq \-\-base main \-\-head feature \-\-draft
\&  ag\-cli pr create owner/repo \-\-title \(dqFix bug\(dq \-\-body\-file description.md \-\-base main \-\-head feature
\&  ag\-cli pr create owner/repo \-\-title \(dqFix bug\(dq \-\-body\-file \- \-\-base main \-\-head feature
\&  ag\-cli pr create owner/repo \-\-title \(dqFix bug\(dq \-\-head feature \-\-prune\-branch
.fi
